# A two-triangle card, and one quad, so the fixture covers both face forms.
# Deliberately includes lines this loader does not read, so the skip COUNT is exercised
# rather than assumed: a parser that ignores what it cannot match silently is the bug.
mtllib nothing.mtl
o card
v 0 0 0
v 10 0 0
v 10 20 0
v 0 20 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vn 0 0 1
usemtl none
s off
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
